ntial; no trademarks; no watermark\n```\n\n### illustration-story\n```\n"}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a08fef-557d-7da2-a11a-a6877624e7ab","create_time":1789121273.808388}}}
